{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1015143-updating-1ed-contracts-to-2ed","id":1015143,"title":"Updating 1ED Contracts To 2ED","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-09T20:32:11-08:00","id":1015143,"title":"Updating 1ED Contracts To 2ED","content":"What it says on the title. Here are two Contracts from the 1ED Core. Feel free to update fan made Contracts as well.<br /> <br /> <b>Display Grandiose Might (\u2022\u2022\u2022) </b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Cost: </b>2 Glamour<br /> <b>Dice Pool: </b>Strength + Athletics + Wyrd<br /> <b>Action: </b>Instant<br /> <br /> <b>Roll Results</b><br /> <br /> <b>Dramatic Failure: </b>The character\u2019s Strength is halved round down and all rolls involving it lose 10 Again.<br /> <br /> <b>Failure: </b>The character\u2019s Strength is unaffected.<br /> <br /> <b>Success: </b>Gain extra Successes on all Strength and Stamina rolls for non combat purposes equal to half your Wyrd, rounded up.<br /> <br /> <b>Exceptional Success: </b>Increase the extra Successes to your whole Wyrd.<br /> <br /> <b>Ogre: </b>You also gain 3 dots in the Strength Performance Style from the Hurt Locker.<br /> <br /> <b>Fairest: </b>You gain +2 on Social rolls against those who were impressed by your display.<br /> <br /> <b>Catch: </b>Same as the original version.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Become The Primal Foundation (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>Cost: </b>4 Glamour + 1 willpower<br /> <b>Dice Pool: </b>Manipulation + Survival + Wyrd<br /> <b>Action: </b>Reflexive<br /> <br /> <b>Roll Results</b><br /> <br /> <b>Dramatic Failure: </b>The character suffers lethal damage equal to half his Wyrd round up.<br /> <br /> <b>Failure: </b>The character fails to transform into the element.<br /> <br /> <b>Success: </b>The character becomes a living embodiment of her element, and retains all her Mental and Social traits.<br /> <br /> For solid elements, add half her Wyrd round up as General Armor, and bonus dots to Strength and Stamina. Her Brawl and Weaponry attacks deal half her Wyrd round up in lethal damage with Armor Piercing at the same rating. This is considered supernatural damage, so it will be lethal even against targets that would normally downgrade it, and pierce magical protections.<br /> <br /> For formless elements, add half her Wyrd round up to Wits and Dexterity and apply her Defense against Firearms. She may direct blasts of her element with a Dexterity + Athletics roll, which inflicts lethal damage. The short range is Wyrd x 10 yards, medium is Wyrd x 20 and long is Wyrd x 40. She downgrades all mundane damage from lethal to bashing, and bashing into nothing. She reflexively heals lethal or bashing damage dealt by mundane attacks at a rate of Wyrd/2 round up every turn.<br /> <br /> In both cases, the bonus to Attributes may take them above the normal limit imposed by Wyrd and increases derived traits. Being hit with a cold iron weapon requires the character to roll Resolve + Composure - damage received. Failure ends the Contract, which cannot be reactivated for a full day. <br /> <br /> <b>Exceptional Success: </b>Treat your Wyrd as two dots higher to calculate the benefits, to a maximum of ten. The Contract also lasts until the next sunrise or sunset (whichever comes first). During this, you may switch between your normal and elemental forms reflexively at no cost.<br /> <br /> <b>Elemental: </b>When assuming a solid elemental form, she may spend 1 glamour to reduce her damage bonus to zero and inflict aggravated damage instead. This bypasses all Durability and non-supernatural Armor. When assuming a formless element, she Dodges reflexively, multiplies her Speed by Wyrd/2 + 1 and may spend 1 glamour to ignore Defense when directing blasts.<br /> <br /> <b>Fairest: </b>All onlookers must roll Resolve + Composure \u2013 the character\u2019s Wyrd. Failure takes away 10 Again from all their dice pools.<br /> <br /> <b>Catch:</b> Same as the original version.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 12-10-2016, 08:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T22:55:19-08:00","id":1015169,"title":"","content":"If you don't mind, I'd like to add these conversions (and any more you cook up) to my own thread for Contract Conversions.<br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edi